Follow this order without becoming trapped in planning.

## Stage 1: Establish the foundation

Create the application, routing, design tokens, responsive layout, TypeScript structure, testing setup, and basic scene.

Run the initial build and resolve setup issues.

## Stage 2: Build the opening

Create the physical workspace, laptop, entry controls, and portal sequence.

Verify that the interaction works.

