Implement the camera choreography, tunnel geometry, state machine, loading, and recovery.

Verify a complete journey.

## Stage 4: Build the orbital hub

Implement destination structures, manipulation, selection, focus movement, reset, and return navigation.

Verify mouse and touch behaviour.

